# The copies of one site that two versions of a stretch of code hold meet in a block parameter. Where that value is only matched with, nobody can tell which object it is
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass ShareRegExpLiterals
# STATISTIC: ShareRegExpLiteralsChanges = 2

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js"
function f0 name="matchedWhereTheyMeet" parameters=[{type=boolean}, {type=string}] results=[{type=boolean}] {
    Branch v0 -> taken b1(), notTaken b2()
  b1():
    v2 = NewRegExp pattern="a" @10
    v3 = CallBuiltin v2, v1 overload=RegExpPrototypeTest/0
    Branch v3 -> taken b3(v2), notTaken b4(v3)
  b2():
    v4 = NewRegExp pattern="a" @10
    Jump -> next b3(v4)
  b3(v5):
    v6 = CallBuiltin v5, v1 overload=RegExpPrototypeTest/0
    Jump -> next b4(v6)
  b4(v7):
    Return v7
# CHECK-COUNT-2: SharedRegExpLiteral pattern="a"
# CHECK-NOT: NewRegExp
}

function f1 name="matchedInTheNextTurn" parameters=[{type=string}] results=[{type=undefined}] {
    v1 = NewRegExp pattern="a" @10
    Jump -> next b1(v1)
  b1(v2):
    LoopHint
    v4 = NewRegExp pattern="a" @20
    v5 = CallBuiltin v2, v0 overload=RegExpPrototypeTest/0
    Branch v5 -> taken b2(), notTaken b1(v4)
  b2():
    Return
# CHECK-COUNT-2: SharedRegExpLiteral pattern="a"
# CHECK-NOT: NewRegExp
}

function f2 name="comparedWhereTheyMeet" parameters=[{type=boolean}, {type=RegExp}] results=[{type=boolean}] {
    Branch v0 -> taken b1(), notTaken b2()
  b1():
    v2 = NewRegExp pattern="a" @10
    Jump -> next b3(v2)
  b2():
    v3 = NewRegExp pattern="a" @10
    Jump -> next b3(v3)
  b3(v4):
    v5 = StrictEq v4, v1
    Return v5
# CHECK-COUNT-2: NewRegExp
# CHECK-NOT: SharedRegExpLiteral
}

function f3 name="twoCopiesInTwoOperands" parameters=[{type=string}] results=[{type=anything}] {
    v1 = NewRegExp pattern="a" @10
    v2 = NewRegExp pattern="a" @10
    v3 = CallBuiltin v0, v1, v2 overload=StringPrototypeReplace/0
    Return v3
# CHECK-COUNT-2: NewRegExp
# CHECK-NOT: SharedRegExpLiteral
}

function f4 name="comparedByABuiltinInTheNextTurn" parameters=[{type=string}] results=[{type=undefined}] {
    v1 = Null
    Jump -> next b1(v1)
  b1(v2):
    LoopHint
    v4 = NewRegExp pattern="a" @10
    v5 = CallBuiltin -, v2, v4 overload=ObjectIs/0
    Branch v5 -> taken b2(), notTaken b1(v4)
  b2():
    Return
# CHECK: NewRegExp
# CHECK-NOT: SharedRegExpLiteral
}
